            "sid": "ISA 52:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA: “Geeshaaydaneegwa mwadaagha, ak gajeetineegwa mwadaagha nea manda lapiyeeda jea oatayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA: Fugeasu ghayi aba mwadi ghwararang'aada gaweay Misri goobiida hoowa nea rabasta gil. Ak ghaghabwas fuga Ashuru saawa mwadaagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa geasinyi naaha aba hiji gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA, nea fugeasu ea siyaat mwadaagha? Ak fuga ambal saawa googuul gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA nea gheawungeasu geeng'eawi galeagasean ea askwearda sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi fugeasu gayghwanal gheawungeasu asi eaweedida gayghwanal gideaba siida balool aniini gil, ng'ula aniini gil.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sawanadeeda siida gadiyeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
